    {
      "bbox": [
        373,
        527,
        1297,
        596
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Title VII of the Civil Rights Act of 1964, as amended by the Equal Employment Opportunity Act of 1972, City, State and other Federal laws prohibit discrimination in employment by public employers; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.253,
          "min": -1.2255
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 48,
          "mean": -0.0106,
          "min": -0.4997
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11099,
        "area_px": 66101,
        "density": 0.16791,
        "chars": 209,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.83
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        375,
        596,
        1297,
        641
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is necessary that the City be eligible and qualified to receive funds from Federal and State agencies; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2075,
          "min": -1.2473
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 23,
          "mean": -0.0101,
          "min": -0.2263
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5973,
        "area_px": 42734,
        "density": 0.13977,
        "chars": 118,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.76
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        375,
        641,
        1297,
        708
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Federal and State Laws and regulations, as they relate to such grants, require the City or the recipient City agency to formulate, implement and maintain an equal employment opportunity program; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1976,
          "min": -1.0329
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 38,
          "mean": -0.0007,
          "min": -0.0233
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10783,
        "area_px": 63172,
        "density": 0.17069,
        "chars": 207,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.2
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        375,
        708,
        1299,
        753
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is the purpose of such laws and regulations, and it has been the policy of the City, to provide equal employment opportunity in all positions of City employment; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.189,
          "min": -1.1438
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 36,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0046
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 8896,
        "area_px": 42826,
        "density": 0.20772,
        "chars": 177,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.9
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        375,
        756,
        1299,
        802
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Such purpose and policy is consistent with a merit system of appointment and promotion in public employment; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1786,
          "min": -1.0576
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 22,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0035
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6392,
        "area_px": 43757,
        "density": 0.14608,
        "chars": 121,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.93
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        375,
        802,
        1299,
        868
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Certain actions have already been undertaken by the City to ensure non-discrimination and equal employment opportunities by removing impediments to the employment and advancement of qualified minorities, women and physically handicapped; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1491,
          "min": -0.9406
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0164
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13224,
        "area_px": 62377,
        "density": 0.212,
        "chars": 250,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.91
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        375,
        868,
        1299,
        934
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is necessary and in the City's interest that all activities relating to equal employment opportunity in City employment, required by law, regulation or City policy, be undertaken as a coordinated effort under the direction of the Office of the Mayor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1686,
          "min": -1.1827
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 49,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0008
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12257,
        "area_px": 62377,
        "density": 0.1965,
        "chars": 262,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.38
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        375,
        934,
        1299,
        978
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by the power vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1654,
          "min": -0.8959
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0006
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0011
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5191,
        "area_px": 41895,
        "density": 0.12391,
        "chars": 108,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.81
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        375,
        978,
        1301,
        1113
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There shall be prepared, under the direction of the Office of the Mayor, by the Department of Personnel, the City Commission on Human Rights and the Law Department for the approval of the Mayor, guidelines setting forth standards and procedures for a City Equal Employment Opportunity Program. The Program guidelines shall comply with applicable federal, state and local laws, regulations and guidelines relating to discrimination in employment.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1989,
          "min": -1.2792
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.1433,
          "min": -0.1433
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 79,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0186
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 23371,
        "area_px": 126888,
        "density": 0.18419,
        "chars": 456,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.51
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        420,
        1113,
        1301,
        1203
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) The City Equal Employment Opportunity Program shall be designed to remove impediments to the employment of and increase employment opportunities and advancement in employment of qualified minorities, women, and the physically handicapped.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1631,
          "min": -1.1143
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
