    {
      "bbox": [
        377,
        1405,
        1301,
        1537
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. Each agency shall then prepare for the approval of the Mayor, an Agency Equal Employment Opportunity Program in accordance with the standards and procedures contained in the approved City Equal Opportunity Program guidelines. Each agency shall submit its Program, including its review, analysis and recommendations prepared under section one of this Order, to the Department of Personnel and City Commission on Human Rights for review and report to the Mayor.",
